          %h2#independence_from_the_measure Independence from the measure
          %p
            In this section, we exhibit a construction of
            = succeed "-spaces" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
